# Shared Types + Jobs

## Job inputs

Discriminated unions with `kind`:

- `'migrate'` → `MigrateJobInput`
- `'backup'` → `BackupJobInput`
- `'restore'` → `RestoreJobInput`

Extend the union in `types.ts` before adding handlers in `jobs.ts`.

## Constants

Define here before hardcoding elsewhere:

- `SERVICES` — kebab-case microservice dirs (`auth-service`, …)
- `DATABASES` — snake_case PG names (`sshr_auth`, …)
- `PRESETS` — connection presets (`cloudBackup`, `localRestore`)
- `MICROSERVICE_ROOT_REL` — default migrate root relative path

## Settings

- `AppSettings` — persisted non-secret prefs only
- `defaultSettings(homeDir, projectBackupDir)` — call from `settings.ts`
- Packaged vs dev backup dir resolved in `main/paths.ts`, not in types

## Events

Job streaming types: `JobStartedEvent`, `JobLogEvent`, `JobEndedEvent`, `JobState`.

## Naming

| Domain | Convention | Example |
|--------|------------|-----------|
| Services | kebab-case | `code-gen-service` |
| Databases | snake_case | `sshr_code_gen` |
| Job kinds | lowercase literal | `'backup'` |
| IPC channels | domain:action | `job:run` |
